#
# https://help.github.com/articles/dealing-with-line-endings/
#
# Keep the Gradle wrapper (and every other text file) checked out with LF so the
# shell scripts stay runnable on Linux/macOS CI even when core.autocrlf is set.
#
* text=auto eol=lf

*.bat        text eol=crlf
*.cmd        text eol=crlf

*.jar        binary
*.png        binary
*.gif        binary
*.mv.db      binary
